": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LE16wY3dljgQ7kNvwGzVbUv&_nc_oc=AdrCckLLn90PXIAJT4sS4FETq1a8oWnOVkv7T_S4O9xGgdiMZ24rPyxt3lZ0mJwOl6k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK_42FcCgBOJQO10K3HcS6eFuH1dYV2ifmrJcdesCP7jg&oe=6A9D575B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qOCfzpSf4hcQ7kNvwEginoj&_nc_oc=AdqkWEJhNkTSbpfxNP9DdWSAwps4jwXU_vIn6r964ksdtkVNT5hx0D4vfhJYLupO2-U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKqCfmx1WmNvAzfTN8UtXwv5XxIamdarTpv2JL4ti7DaQ&oe=6A9D7FE1"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hoe9lI9cPywQ7kNvwHYnVcB&_nc_oc=AdryMoOojmL4roHpbkdVQdIPzAHUulFwBC3M7uQ5TfMJPQl6THD5dBBsllMBMJTi_b0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKpJ5uvutMtnmP_lEo8hRplkkgq97l0D8BC3Dsthlmjew&oe=6A9D6CAF"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7PFHfU4D2F0Q7kNvwGQw1Qu&_nc_oc=AdpGb5-Bq1DagX2ayQT-FkHqELe9QAVCC8lRZozK2WBMQWwv1q9NmYu2K9FkLNMVAB4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLKwGVcaLxod4KwtMvhrbQ7BnSv7z536FG2WY8g4MZijw&oe=6A9D6C52"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YLisxChRx9gQ7kNvwF4tfWP&_nc_oc=AdrE8YROJrXF-2HhrK3iy0RNRI-rhtxHd-Ggf_akTgASgBPZuF0ax06rzjsK9rur8ZU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJiaRB4fugeZRehV8TUu8FqZNcVwWwDV-MWCuZk7IwNEw&oe=6A9D75FD"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a